<article class="reader">
  <h1>about reshaped.</h1>
  <p class="reader__lede">A product design studio led by Aaron Benjamin. We help teams make sense of what they are building.</p>
</article>

<div class="section-break">
  <span class="section-break__num">II</span>
  <span>THE PRACTITIONER</span>
</div>

<article class="reader">
  <h2>work directly with Aaron.</h2>
  <p>Aaron leads the work, from understanding the product to designing its key journeys and screens. You review the decisions with the person making them.</p>
  <p>The practice uses object-oriented UX: identifying the things people manage, the information they need, and the actions they take. That structure gives us a shared language for designing the product.</p>
</article>

<div class="section-break">
  <span class="section-break__num">III</span>
  <span>OUR PRINCIPLES</span>
</div>

<article class="reader">
  <h2>understand the work.</h2>
  <p>Start with the people using the product and the tasks they need to finish. Their language, constraints, and questions guide the design.</p>

  <h2>connect the whole product.</h2>
  <p>A screen belongs to a larger system. We consider how information, actions, and navigation fit together, so people can recognize what they are working with and what comes next.</p>

  <h2>make decisions visible.</h2>
  <p>A useful design explains its reasoning. We record the evidence, tradeoffs, and open questions so your team can review the direction and carry it forward.</p>

  <p><a href="{{ '/how-we-work/' | url }}" class="forward-cue">How we work</a></p>
</article>

